                                                "sense_id": "e2a91d1e-e512-3749-977c-b1a5129ced68",
                                                "text": "Shanakdekhete's namesake was a candace of the 160s B.C.E. who appears to have been the first sole female ruler of Meroe; her name appears on the Meroitic hieroglyphs at Naga, among the earliest examples of Meroitic known."
